title: Welcome to Vivid
tags: Intro Design

This is the !!Vivid!! theme — a dark, glassy look with fat saturated colours.

The sidebar uses translucent ''glass'' panels, a gradient wordmark, pill-shaped tabs and a glowing search box. Hover the page-control icons to see them lift and shift to magenta.

Accent palette: <<colour primary>> violet, cyan and magenta over a deep near-black field.

* Soft radii and blur
* Saturated accents
* Built for animation next
